                <div class='avia_textblock  ' itemprop="text">
                  <p>The estimating team at Estimating meets in person to discuss the scope of work.</p>
                  <p>This procedure also includes commercial estimation responsibilities for trade professionals.</p>
                  <h3><strong>Utilizing Modern Software:</strong></h3>
                  <p>The trade-specialized estimators import the plans after reviewing the client&#8217;s project documentation and requirements, and they digitally take off the amounts by measuring the dimensions and scales using the most recent software.</p>
                  <h3><strong>Gathering Data:</strong></h3>
                  <p>After the on-screen data collection is finished, all takeoff amounts are exported and organized in EXCEL spreadsheets in accordance with the divides and trends of CSI costs.</p>
                  <h3><strong>Labor and Materials:</strong></h3>
                  <p>Prevailing wages, union rates, standard time, and overtime pay are all taken into consideration when determining the cost of materials and labor for each task. We work closely with regional suppliers and RSMeans to provide accurate pricing.</p>
                  <h3>Quality Assurance Procedure</h3>
                  <p>The final quality assurance inspection of the project deliverables is then carried out by the lead estimator as a part of the quality control procedure.</p>
